# Kubeflow Model Registry API Unavailable

This monitor detects an unsuccessful Model Registry API check for [{{labels.service_name}}](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}).

Compare the metric and threshold in this monitor's chart at the time of the alert.

Triage:

1. Check the deployment and endpoints: `kubectl get deploy,pod,svc,endpoints -n <kubeflow-namespace> | grep model-registry`.
2. Inspect application logs: `kubectl logs -n <kubeflow-namespace> deploy/model-registry-deployment --tail=200`.
3. Test the API from inside the collector namespace with the configured Authorization header.
4. Verify `MODEL_REGISTRY_BEARER_TOKEN`, network policies, and Kubeflow AuthorizationPolicy behavior.
5. Check the registry database before restarting the deployment.
